import { i as createComponent, n as maybeRenderHead, r as unescapeHTML, t as renderTemplate } from "./server_Cxecs7oA.mjs";
// src/content/posts/deveco-session-01.md
var html = () => "<blockquote>\n<p>本文首发于稀土掘金，同步发布于 CSDN、华为开发者联盟、微信公众号。掘金原文：<a href=\"https://juejin.cn/post/7710125642353508403\">https://juejin.cn/post/7710125642353508403</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"先说结论\">先说结论</h2>\n<p>前几天 DevEco Code 大版本更新，打开一看，<code>/session</code> 面板里几十个历史会话<strong>一夜清空</strong>——最心疼的是其中一个攒了 1.7 万条消息的会话，等于 AI 的“长期记忆”直接蒸发。</p>\n<p>折腾一番之后结论是：<strong>数据一个字节都没丢</strong>。所谓的“丢失”，是新版本在三个层面同时“换了说法”，导致它认不出自己的旧数据。本文记录完整排查链路和修复代码，思路适用于所有“本地 SQLite + 高频迭代”的 AI 工具。</p>\n<p><strong>涉及的具体版本</strong>（这个必须说清楚，不同版本行为完全不同）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>更新前</th>\n<th>更新后</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>形态</td>\n<td>独立命令行工具 devecocli（<code>devecocli --version</code> = 0.2.6，历史会话从 0.1.0 一路攒到 0.2.5）</td>\n<td>DevEco Studio 26.0（26.0.1.290）内置的 deveco-code v1，独立 CLI 沦为 1.3.9 的转发壳，真身是一个 Bun 打包的 <code>deveco.exe</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据库</td>\n<td><code>~\\.local\\share\\deveco\\deveco.db</code></td>\n<td><code>...\\DevEcoStudio26.0\\deveco-code\\v1\\data\\deveco-stable.db</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>项目 ID</td>\n<td>项目<strong>路径</strong>的哈希</td>\n<td>项目 git <strong>初始提交哈希</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上下文压缩部件</td>\n<td><code>type:\"snip\"</code></td>\n<td><code>type:\"compaction\"</code>（snip 被整个移除）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>旧库里 56 个会话、时间跨度 5 个月，全部完好。下面按排查顺序讲三层根因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"第一层数据库文件搬家了而且没人告诉你\">第一层：数据库文件搬家了，而且没人告诉你</h2>\n<p>第一步先确认“数据是被删了，还是被藏了”。回收站、卸载残留、同目录旧文件全查了一遍，最后在用户目录下同时找到两个库——旧的 679MB（56 个会话），新的当时只有一个当前会话。</p>\n<p>也就是说：<strong>新版本把存储位置整体搬迁，且没有任何迁移逻辑</strong>。数据没丢，只是搬家后没把新地址告诉 anyone。</p>\n<h2 id=\"第二层项目-id-的生成规则变了\">第二层：项目 ID 的生成规则变了</h2>\n<p>把旧库数据合进新库（怎么合的见下文），会话列表还是空的。继续挖，发现 <code>session.project_id</code> 这列的含义变了：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>旧版：<code>sha256(项目绝对路径)</code>，比如 <code>dd8d8d63...</code></li>\n<li>新版：项目 git 仓库的<strong>初始提交哈希</strong>，比如 <code>cd0de57...</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p>会话列表按“当前项目的 project_id”过滤，路径哈希和 git 提交哈希当然对不上。解法很直接：把旧会话的 <code>project_id</code> 重映射成当前仓库的初始提交哈希。</p>\n<h2 id=\"第三层snip-部件在新版-schema-里被整个删了最隐蔽\">第三层：<code>snip</code> 部件在新版 schema 里被整个删了（最隐蔽）</h2>\n<p>前两层修完，会话能列出来了，满心欢喜点开，报错：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>加载对话失败： Internal error: DevEco Code service failure</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>这种笼统报错最劝退。翻服务日志，55 条 <code>schema rejection</code>，全是同一个原因：</p>\n<pre class=\"astro-code github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8; overflow-x: auto;\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"plaintext\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>level=WARN message=\"schema rejection\" kind=Body</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>reason=\"Expected Part, got {\\\"type\\\":\\\"snip\\\",\\\"snippedCount\\\":353,\\\"replacedCount\\\":2195,...}\"</span></span></code></pre>\n<p>背景知识：AI 会话上下文超长时会自动压缩，旧版用一种 <code>type:\"snip\"</code> 的部件（Part）在消息流里标记“这里压缩掉了 N 轮”，只存元数据（压缩轮数、释放的 token 数），<strong>不含对话内容</strong>。新版把 snip 整个删了，换成 <code>type:\"compaction\"</code>。加载会话时响应体要过 schema 校验，遇到不认识的 snip 直接抛 <code>HttpApiSchemaError</code>，UI 层就显示成了 “Internal error”。</p>\n<p>怎么确认“新版真的不认 snip”而不是我猜的？新版主程序是一个 181MB 的 Bun 打包单文件二进制，<strong>内嵌 JS 源码是明文</strong>。用 Python 按字节搜索：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>\"snip\"</code> / <code>\"snippedCount\"</code> → <strong>0 次命中</strong>（功能确实被移除）</li>\n<li><code>\"compaction\"</code> → 69 次命中（新压缩机制的完整 schema 就在那儿）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这个技巧对 Bun/pkg/esbuild 打包的二进制普遍适用，比猜文档靠谱多了。</p>\n<h2 id=\"修复方案\">修复方案</h2>\n<h3 id=\"迁移方向怎么选\">迁移方向怎么选</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>候选</th>\n<th>思路</th>\n<th>取舍</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>A. 新版指回旧库</td>\n<td>改配置让新版读旧库</td>\n<td>当前会话在新库会失联；配置无文档支持，脆弱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>B. 旧库正向合并入新库（选定）</strong></td>\n<td>按列名 INSERT 8 张表 + 项目 ID 重映射</td>\n<td>新库是今后的唯一事实源；一次性、可验证、可回滚；两库 drizzle migration 均为 35/35，业务表列名完全一致，可行性已实证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C. 仅导出文本</td>\n<td>旧会话转 markdown</td>\n<td>只能看不能续聊，作为 B 失败的兜底</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"完整合并脚本\">完整合并脚本</h3>\n<p>关键细节：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>备份必须用 SQLite backup API，不能直接拷文件</strong>——库开在 WAL 模式且被进程占用时，直接复制 <code>.db</code> 不是可靠备份（最新数据可能还在 <code>-wal</code> 里没落盘）；</li>\n<li><strong>按列名映射，不按位置</strong>——新库是全新建表，列序和旧库 ALTER 增列的结果不一样；</li>\n<li>合并顺序按外键依赖，<strong>单事务</strong>写入，失败即回滚；</li>\n<li>旧库用 <code>?mode=ro</code> 只读打开，全程零风险。</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"astro-code github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8; overflow-x: auto;\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"python\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D\"># merge_db.py —— 旧库(deveco.db)正向合并入新库(deveco-stable.db)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D\"># Python 3 标准库，无第三方依赖</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> sqlite3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D\"># 把\"你的用户名\"替换成自己的 Windows 用户名</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">OLD_PATH</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#DBEDFF\">file:C:/Users/你的用户名/</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#DBEDFF\">local/share/deveco/deveco</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#DBEDFF\">db</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#DBEDFF\">mode=ro</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D\">  # 旧库，只读打开</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">NEW_RAW</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">  =</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#DBEDFF\">C:/Users/你的用户名/AppData/Local/Huawei/DevEcoStudio26</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#DBEDFF\">0/deveco-code/v1/data/deveco-stable</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#DBEDFF\">db</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D\"># 旧项目ID(路径哈希) -&gt; 新项目ID(git初始提交哈希)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D\"># 下面两个哈希仅为示例，替换成你自己的：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D\">#   旧 ID：在旧库执行 SELECT DISTINCT project_id FROM session 查询</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D\">#   新 ID：在新库执行同样语句查询</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">REMAP</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">    \"dd8d8d63e717b2b9fd478120c48d64d7f62bb052\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"cd0de57f175f8e962561dbeafb6d4c840a9e3c61\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">old </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> sqlite3.connect(</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">OLD_PATH</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#FFAB70\">uri</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">)          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D\"># 只读</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">new </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> sqlite3.connect(</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">NEW_RAW</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#FFAB70\">timeout</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">new.execute(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"PRAGMA busy_timeout=20000\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> cols</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(cur, t):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"取新库表 t 的列名列表 —— 以新库列为准做交集，天然按列名映射\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> [r[</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> r </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> cur.execute(</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"PRAGMA table_info(</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">t</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">)\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">).fetchall()]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> existing</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(cur, t, keycols):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"取新库已有主键集合，用于跳过重复（幂等）\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    sel </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> \", \"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">.join(keycols)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    rows </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> cur.execute(</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">'SELECT </span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">sel</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> FROM \"</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">t</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"'</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">).fetchall()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> set</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(r[</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> r </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> rows) </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(keycols) </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> else</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> set</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(rows)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> fetch_old</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(t):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    cl </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> cols(new, t)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    sel </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> \", \"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">.join(</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">'\"</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">c</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"'</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> for</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> c </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> cl)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> cl, old.execute(</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">'SELECT </span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">sel</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> FROM \"</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">t</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"'</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">).fetchall()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">report </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">try</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    new.execute(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"BEGIN IMMEDIATE\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D\"># 单事务：全部成功才提交</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D\">    # 1) project：全量导入新库没有的</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    cl, rows </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> fetch_old(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"project\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    have </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> existing(new, </span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"project\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, [</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    ins </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> [r </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> r </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> rows </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> r[</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">not</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> in</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> have]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    new.executemany(</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">'INSERT INTO project (</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\", \"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">.join(cl)</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">) VALUES (</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\", \"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">.join(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"?\"</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(cl))</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">)'</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, ins)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    report[</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"project\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(rows), </span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(ins))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D\">    # 2) event_sequence：主键去重</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    cl, rows </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> fetch_old(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"event_sequence\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    have </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> existing(new, </span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"event_sequence\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, [</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"aggregate_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    ins </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> [r </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> r </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> rows </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> r[</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">not</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> in</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> have]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    new.executemany(</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">'INSERT INTO event_sequence (</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\", \"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">.join(cl)</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">) VALUES (</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\", \"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">.join(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"?\"</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(cl))</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">)'</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, ins)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    report[</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"event_sequence\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(rows), </span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(ins))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D\">    # 3) session：核心步骤 —— project_id 重映射</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    cl, rows </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> fetch_old(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"session\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    pj </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> cl.index(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"project_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    have </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> existing(new, </span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"session\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, [</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    ins </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">tuple</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">REMAP</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">.get(r[pj], r[pj]) </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> pj </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> v</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">                 for</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> i, v </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> enumerate</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(r))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">           for</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> r </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> rows </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> r[</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">not</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> in</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> have]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    new.executemany(</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">'INSERT INTO session (</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\", \"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">.join(cl)</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">) VALUES (</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\", \"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">.join(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"?\"</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(cl))</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">)'</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, ins)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    report[</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"session\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(rows), </span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(ins))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D\">    # 4) 消息三件套 + 事件流：id 去重直插</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> t </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"session_message\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"message\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"part\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"event\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">        cl, rows </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> fetch_old(t)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">        have </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> existing(new, t, [</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">        ins </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> [r </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> r </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> rows </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> r[</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">not</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> in</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> have]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">        new.executemany(</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">'INSERT INTO </span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">t</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\", \"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">.join(cl)</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">) VALUES (</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\", \"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">.join(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"?\"</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(cl))</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">)'</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, ins)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">        report[t] </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(rows), </span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(ins))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D\">    # 5) todo：复合主键 (session_id, position) 去重</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    cl, rows </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> fetch_old(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"todo\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    have </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> existing(new, </span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"todo\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, [</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"session_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"position\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    si, po </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> cl.index(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"session_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">), cl.index(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"position\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    ins </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> [r </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> r </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> rows </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> (r[si], r[po]) </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">not</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> in</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> have]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    new.executemany(</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">'INSERT INTO todo (</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\", \"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">.join(cl)</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">) VALUES (</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\", \"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">.join(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"?\"</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(cl))</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">)'</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, ins)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    report[</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"todo\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(rows), </span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(ins))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    new.commit()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"合并提交成功\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">except</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> Exception</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> as</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> e:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    new.rollback()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"已回滚！错误:\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, e)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">    raise</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">finally</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    old.close(); new.close()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">tot_old </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> tot_ins </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> t, (a, b) </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> report.items():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"  </span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">t</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">: 旧库</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">a</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> / 导入</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">b</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    tot_old </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> a; tot_ins </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"  合计: 旧库</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">tot_old</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> / 导入</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">tot_ins</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre>\n<p>动手前，我还做了一轮防御性核对：旧库 7 种部件类型（tool / step-start / step-finish / text / reasoning / compaction / file）的顶层字段集，全部是新版对应部件的<strong>子集</strong>——也就是说除了 snip，其它类型天然兼容，不用改一个字节。</p>\n<p>结果：37.6 万行（56 会话、2 万消息、8 万部件）合入新库，<code>/session</code> 列表恢复。</p>\n<h3 id=\"snip-部件删还是转\">snip 部件：删还是转？</h3>\n<p>3 个会话共 207 个 snip 部件挡在路上。两个方案：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>删除</strong>：最省事，但如果某个消息的唯一部件恰好是 snip，删掉会产生空消息，还会丢失“此处曾压缩过”的语义标记；</li>\n<li><strong>转换（选定）</strong>：原地 UPDATE 成一段普通文本，既过校验、又保留标记、不产生空消息，只损失纯簿记字段（压缩了多少轮、释放多少 token），<strong>对话内容一个字不丢</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"astro-code github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8; overflow-x: auto;\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"python\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D\"># fix_snip.py —— snip 部件转 text 标记</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> sqlite3, json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">NEW</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#DBEDFF\">C:/Users/你的用户名/AppData/Local/Huawei/DevEcoStudio26</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#DBEDFF\">0/deveco-code/v1/data/deveco-stable</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#DBEDFF\">db</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">BAK</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#DBEDFF\">C:/Users/你的用户名/AppData/Local/Huawei/DevEcoStudio26</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#DBEDFF\">0/deveco-code/v1/data/deveco-stable</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#DBEDFF\">backup-20261120-postmerge</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#DBEDFF\">db</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D\"># 1) 先备份！服务占用中，必须用 backup API（拷文件在 WAL 模式下不是可靠备份）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">src </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> sqlite3.connect(</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">NEW</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">dst </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> sqlite3.connect(</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">BAK</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">src.backup(dst)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">dst.close()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"备份完成: </span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">{BAK}</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D\"># 2) 事务内转换 snip -&gt; text</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">cur </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> src.cursor()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">rows </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> cur.execute(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">    \"SELECT id, data FROM part WHERE json_extract(data,'$.type')='snip'\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">).fetchall()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"待转换 snip 部件: </span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">{len</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(rows)</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> 个\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">cur.execute(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"BEGIN\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">converted </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> pid, data </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> rows:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    d </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> json.loads(data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    n </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> d.get(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"snippedCount\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    marker </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"[此前</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">n</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">轮较早对话已被自动压缩省略]\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">              if</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> isinstance</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(n, </span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> \"[较早对话已被自动压缩省略]\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    newdata </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> json.dumps({</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"text\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"text\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">: marker},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#FFAB70\">                         ensure_ascii</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">False</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#FFAB70\">separators</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\",\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\":\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    cur.execute(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">        \"UPDATE part SET data=? WHERE id=? AND json_extract(data,'$.type')='snip'\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">        (newdata, pid))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    converted </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> cur.rowcount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">src.commit()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"已转换: </span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">converted</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> 个\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D\"># 3) 验证</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">remain </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> cur.execute(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">    \"SELECT COUNT(*) FROM part WHERE json_extract(data,'$.type')='snip'\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">).fetchone()[</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"剩余 snip 部件: </span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">remain</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">src.close()</span></span></code></pre>\n<p>修复后复查：<code>snip</code> 剩余 0 条，日志里 <code>schema rejection</code> 归零，旧会话正常加载，可以继续续聊。</p>\n<h2 id=\"踩过的坑\">踩过的坑</h2>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>统计 JSON 字段别用 <code>LIKE</code></strong>。排查时用 <code>LIKE '%\"type\":\"snip\"%'</code> 数数量，结果虚高——因为<strong>我自己排查会话的工具输出里，就包含含有这个字面量的 SQL 脚本</strong>，自己匹配到了自己。精确统计必须用 <code>json_extract(data,'$.type')</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>WAL 模式的库，直接拷 <code>.db</code> 文件 ≠ 备份</strong>。最新写入可能还在 <code>-wal</code> 里。要么用 backup API，要么先正常关闭写进程。</li>\n<li><strong>笼统报错的背后，日志里通常躺着精确原因</strong>。“Internal error” 吓人，<code>schema rejection</code> 一行就把根因钉死了。</li>\n<li>最好在改库前关掉正在使用它的工具进程。我当时没法关（那个工具就是我自己 😅），靠 <code>BEGIN IMMEDIATE</code> + <code>busy_timeout</code> 硬着头皮上的，能成但不算稳妥操作。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"经验总结\">经验总结</h2>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>“AI 工具升级 = 上下文清零”多半是假象</strong>。先定位存储层事实（哪个文件、什么格式、数据在不在），再谈方案。数据一分钟能定位完，怕的是不找就放弃。</li>\n<li><strong>跨版本数据迁移要过三关</strong>：存储位置 → 表结构 → <strong>数据内部 schema（部件/消息类型有没有被增删）</strong>。第三关最隐蔽：表结构完全一致，照样能栽进去。</li>\n<li><strong>AI 工具的会话数据就是你自己的数据资产</strong>。官方没给导出/迁移通道之前，定期备份本地库是唯一可靠的保险——这次能救回来，一半功劳属于“旧文件没被删除”，这事儿下次可不一定。</li>\n<li>Bun/pkg 打包的二进制内嵌 JS 明文，按字节搜索是逆向“新版到底支持什么”的捷径。</li>\n</ol>\n";
